      "lines": [
        "恒等式(3)在除去 $\\alpha=\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi n\\ (n\\in\\mathbb{Z})$ 这种形式的点以外的",
        "实数集上成立。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习题",
        "证明恒等式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "325",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "325. $\\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{1+\\cos\\alpha}=\\frac{1-\\cos\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "326",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "326. $\\frac{\\sin\\alpha+\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha}{1+\\cos\\alpha}=\\operatorname{tg}\\alpha$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "327",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "327. $\\frac{\\cos\\alpha+\\sin\\alpha}{\\cos\\alpha-\\sin\\alpha}=\\operatorname{tg}\\left(\\alpha+\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "323",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "323. $\\frac{\\cos\\alpha}{1+\\sin\\alpha}=\\operatorname{tg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "329",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "329. $\\operatorname{tg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{x}{2}\\right)-\\operatorname{tg}\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)=2\\operatorname{tg}x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "330",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "330. $\\frac{\\sin\\alpha+\\sin3\\alpha}{\\cos\\alpha+\\cos3\\alpha}=\\operatorname{tg}2\\alpha$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "331",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "331. $\\frac{\\sin(x-\\pi)\\operatorname{tg}\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)}{\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}+x\\right)\\operatorname{ctg}(\\pi-x)}=-1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "332",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "332. $\\cos x\\operatorname{tg}(\\pi+x)\\operatorname{tg}\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}-x\\right)\\frac{1}{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right)}=1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "333",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "333. $\\frac{\\cos^2\\left(\\alpha-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)}{\\sin(\\alpha-\\pi)}=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha\\right)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "334",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "334. $\\frac{\\sin^2(\\alpha-630^\\circ)}{1+\\sin(-\\alpha)}=1+\\cos(\\alpha-90^\\circ)$。"
      ]
    },
